    "description": "PROVISIONAL. No published contract exists. Routes come from https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/sre-agent/api-reference; the create body and list envelope match microsoft/mcp tools/Azure.Mcp.Tools.SreAgent. top/skip/filter follow the proposed az sre thread list options and are not service-verified. Thread is open-ended so unknown fields are preserved. The version is a local snapshot label, not a wire api-version."
